  While studying his spells, Guerin looked up to see that an incorporeal 
Platinum Wand had suddenly appeared and was floating in the air in front of 
Guerin.  An enchanting voice spoke from some other dimension, saying "This 
is the Platinum Wand, once used by the Arch-Mages of the Ancient Empire 
which, as you know, collapsed many centuries ago.  It is yours only for as 
long as you are the greatest Mage in the world, and can be given to no other 
character.  The Wand has the power to sense the presence of other magic 
items in the same province: whenever you move into a province, it will tell 
you which magic items are present, but not where they are".

Angel of Death            Uga-Buga Makumb  2    76   None
